ls! Takeru must make the most of his enhanced physical strength, unbelievable magic power, and the \"Search\" ability that allows him to find items of worth as his great isekai journey begins!"},{"language":"ja-JP","overview":"異世界へと転生したごく普通のサラリーマン・神城タケル。剣と魔法の世界である「マデウス」で新たな人生をスタートさせる事となった彼には多くの能力が備わっていた！身体能力強化にトンデモ魔力、そして、価値のあるものを見つけ出せる「探査能力」ーー与えられたチート級の力を駆使して、タケルの異世界大旅行が幕を開ける!!"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ctSVeC7H1YUp0mszrFdUMBUd3fF.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ctSVeC7H1YUp0mszrFdUMBUd3fF.png","language":"en","width":799,"height":640},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rJTHPbPBDBAvkNQ47IQnVZp8d4Z.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rJTHPbPBDBAvkNQ47IQnVZp8d4Z.png","language":"ja","width":917,"height":400}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AtpIf9wnT6IaHoG31XsdqZEEf80.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/AtpIf9wnT6IaHoG31XsdqZEEf80.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ee2BZAt1ddHIcGXUilAYFfzTFLI.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ee2BZAt1ddHIcGXUilAYFfzTFLI.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oD4HawWJxmIGNzqwNw7SCFNjaoV.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oD4HawWJxmIGNzqwNw7SCFNjaoV.jpg","language":"ja","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7uW8DjN1ukRd3GKIswzMVMpDDMh.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7uW8DjN1ukRd3GKIswzMVMpDDMh.jpg","language":"ja","width":1414,"height":2000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rzz8ljepAqeVzd0jPhfmA18Avud.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rzz8ljepAqeVzd0jPhfmA18Avud.jpg","language":"ja","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hq61AkcpoP2kndCYBOFyJ